{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26533","headline":"送刘禹锡郎中赴苏州 一 · 姚合","name":"送刘禹锡郎中赴苏州 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来天下名，衔恩东守阖闾城。\n初经咸谷眠山驿，渐入梁园问水程。\n霁日满江寒浪静，春风遶郭白苹生。\n虎丘野寺吴中少，谁伴吟诗月里行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}